 6 |     for $i in range[from: 1, to: $xs.len[min: 100]]:
   |                                         ^
 what: getting an item says `pos:` or `offset.items:`
 why:  `pos:` counts from 1, and `offset.items:` counts from 0, so the word says which you mean (D133, D144)
